BT 1 0 0 1 0 32 Tm /F2 20 Tf 26 TL 22.70489 0 Td (PLC-Based Automatic Bottling and AI-Based) Tj T* 125.55000 0 Td (Quality Inspection) Tj T* -148.25489 0 Td ET
