BT 1 0 0 1 0 60 Tm /F1 10 Tf 14 TL 3.35498 Tw (Automation has become an important part of modern manufacturing because it improves process) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.21248 Tw (consistency, reduces manual intervention, and supports product quality. In the food and beverage) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.223314 Tw (industry, bottle filling requires accurate bottle positioning, controlled liquid dispensing, and inspection of) Tj T* 0 Tw .413555 Tw (the final product. Manual inspection can be time-consuming and may lead to inconsistent decisions when) Tj T* 0 Tw (large numbers of bottles must be checked.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 62.69291 440.8661 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 60 Tm /F1 10 Tf 14 TL .834597 Tw (Programmable Logic Controllers \(PLCs\) are widely used to control industrial equipment such as motors,) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.565697 Tw (sensors, pumps, and conveyors. In a bottle filling system, a PLC can coordinate conveyor movement,) Tj T* 0 Tw .530751 Tw (detect bottle arrival, control filling duration, and manage the filling sequence. However, conventional PLC) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.052651 Tw (control using sensors and fixed timers does not independently identify visual bottle defects or verify the) Tj T* 0 Tw (actual water level and visible spillage.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 62.69291 378.8661 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 46 Tm /F1 10 Tf 14 TL .334983 Tw (Computer vision can support these inspection tasks by analysing images captured by a camera. OpenCV) Tj T* 0 Tw .72816 Tw (provides image-processing techniques such as thresholding, edge detection, and contour analysis, while) Tj T* 0 Tw .914597 Tw (You Only Look Once \(YOLO\) is a deep-learning-based object-detection method that can identify trained) Tj T* 0 Tw (object and defect categories.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 62.69291 316.8661 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 46 Tm /F1 10 Tf 14 TL 2.699979 Tw (This literature survey examines existing research on bottle inspection, surface-defect detection, and) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.496905 Tw (liquid-content estimation. It also identifies research gaps and establishes the basis for developing a) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.77229 Tw (low-cost prototype that combines an Allen-Bradley MicroLogix 1400 PLC with YOLO and OpenCV for) Tj T* 0 Tw (bottle filling and quality inspection.) Tj T* ET
